# Built binaries for xiaozhi -- deliberately kept local-only (2026-09-08):
# flashing merged-binary.bin reconnects to Grey's own XiaoZhi agent on
# xiaozhi.me (device activation is bound server-side to this board's
# hardware ID), and the OTA push token used to be hardcoded in it. Keep
# these off GitHub; rebuild from xiaozhi-esp32-src instead of relying on
# a committed copy.
